  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "強制執行法",
    "sub_ename": "LAW RELATING TO COMPULSORY EXECUTION",
    "describe_ch": "以課程講述及案例討論為主，採用實際案例作為教材，針對不同性質的權利，討論各種強制執行的法律問題。課程內容包含強制執行案例分析、法拍活動觀察及異議程序研討等。學習者經由實務案例分析，歸納各項執行效果的利弊得失，培養其對於強制執行實務之操作能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The class includes lecturing and group discussion. Real case will be adopted as teaching material. Categorizing different kinds of rights, the civil enforcement procedure sets different methods and channels which will be explored in class. Case study, compulsory auction observation, and objection process are the main content in the course. By analyzing benefits and disadvantages of an enforcement procedure, students will know how to handle the real case in civil enforcement.",
    "pre_subname": "ELAW7021民事訴訟法(一)、ELAW7022民事訴訟法(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ELAW7021",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ELAW7021  CODE OF CIVIL PROCEDURE（I）、ELAW7022 CODE OF CIVIL PROCEDURE（II）",
